bl:Evidence_StoryBuildPageABox a backlog:Evidence, owl:NamedIndividual ;
    backlog:belongsToLineage bl:CodeAbundanceLineage ;
    rdfs:label "Real page ABox built and verified: every applicable gate PASS, including 18/18 intention coverage"@en ;
    backlog:evidenceVerified true ;
    backlog:verifiedAt "2026-09-01T00:00:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    backlog:hasVerificationMethod "Resolved the design question by direct investigation of the real page's own JS, not by force-fitting the old pattern: found principleDetailHTML(p), a genuine per-concept interaction rendering real framework citations and typed relation chips, each independently clickable -- confirmed live via Playwright (57 real clickable navigation chips rendered on a real click) before writing any triple. Built code_abundance_page_abox_v1_4_0.ttl: 18 ChapterSections (one per real Stage 2 leaf concept, not the old pattern's 21 flat sections -- Cross.B chain confirmed 18/18 unbroken), 18 InstructionalWidgets each instantiating a new, honestly-named primitive (ca:PrincipleDetailNavigator, genuinely distinct from the old CitationDisclosureToggle), and 7 real LearningObjectives (one per actual category, not invented). Re-ran every applicable real gate fresh: Stage4.A parse PASS (391 triples); Stage4.B SHACL PASS (0 violations); Cross.B PASS (18/18 provenance chains unbroken); Stage4.H (widget warrant) PASS; Stage4.I (widget grounding) PASS; Stage4.J (widget design-test) PASS; Stage4.K (intention coverage) PASS -- 18/18 covered, 0 disclosed-scope, 0 decoration widgets, genuinely stronger than the old pattern's own ABox, which declared 6 learning objectives but linked zero widgets to any of them (all disclosed-uncovered)." .

