    backlog:hasVerificationMethod "Retired the superseded old-pattern page files (code_abundance_page_v1_1_0.html + its abox) to 99-retired/, per the standing no-multi-version-clutter rule -- Path B is now the sole shipped Stage 4 artifact. Renamed all 4 real stage files to v1_3_0 (research, domain tbox/abox/shacl, document, interactive-page), updating each file's own owl:versionInfo to match. Searched for cross-file filename references before assuming the rename was complete, and found real stale references -- including a genuinely pre-existing bug unrelated to this rename: domain_abox and domain_shacl's own dcterms:description text referenced 'code_abundance_domain_tbox_v1_0_0.ttl', a version domain_tbox had not carried since long before this session began. Fixed all 6 found references (both the ones this rename would have created and the pre-existing one) to point at the new v1_3_0 filenames. Re-verified, not assumed: re-ran all 9 real RDODI Stage1-3 gates fresh against the renamed files, all 9 PASS; re-ran real headless Playwright against the renamed page, confirmed correct title and 0 console/page errors. Direct check confirms Cross.D: exactly one version (v1_3_0) across all 4 stage files." .

