bl:CodeAbundanceAdoptionProfile a backlog:AdoptionProfile, owl:NamedIndividual ;
    backlog:belongsToLineage bl:CodeAbundanceLineage ;
    rdfs:label "code-abundance-rdodi BRSF adoption profile"@en ;
    backlog:governsBacklog bl:CodeAbundanceBacklog ;
    backlog:adoptsFacet backlog:CoreFacet, backlog:EvidenceFacet, backlog:InvariantFacet, backlog:AuditFacet ;
    backlog:hasConformanceLevel backlog:L2_EvidenceBound ;
    backlog:hasTargetConformanceLevel backlog:L3_Governed ;
    backlog:hasLevelReviewDate "2026-11-25T00:00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    backlog:decidedBy backlog:Owner ;
    backlog:hasDecisionRationale "Real, executed gate-verification culture already exists in this package (RDODI's own 4-stage pipeline, re-run and re-verified at every version, most recently 2026-08-31); not yet at the deployment/drift/measured-objective enforcement L3/L4 require. L1 would understate what already holds: Done items in this package's history have carried verified evidence throughout, which is exactly L2's bar. L3_Governed re-test-driven fresh on 2026-08-31 (not trusted from any earlier measurement): 8 violations, all the same class -- every one of the register's 8 Objectives has no checkpoint. Not promoted to L3 on that result: with zero WorkItems yet Done, L3's Done-anchored checks (deployment verification, per-item re-verification, executable cross-cutting invariants) would be vacuously satisfied rather than genuinely exercised, per G4 (completion is not accomplishment); and per G31 (discipline v7.0.0), a checkpoint needs a real predicted value by a real date, which with zero PlanningEvent/Iteration/KickOff in this backlog would be fabricated, not derived from actual planning. Promotion is deferred until at least one Story completes a full cycle through real planning and L3 is re-tested against genuine Done/evidence content."^^xsd:string .
